<title>UK: Austria sets 150 million rand bond due 1999.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 150 million rand bond due 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AUSTRIA, REPUBLIC OF</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     15	  MATURITY    18.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
